---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import logo from '../assets/logo.png';

const sections = [
  {
    id: 'developer',
    title: 'Software developer life',
    items: [
      {
        text: 'I am the founder & CEO of my own company!',
        href: 'https://www.wizarddeosolutions.com/',
        label: 'Wizard Deo Solutions',
      },
      {
        text: 'GitHub only has a fraction of my code because of NDAs…',
        href: 'https://github.com/Deovandski',
        label: 'github.com/Deovandski',
      },
      {
        text: '…But on GitHub, I am proud of this little project I cooked up for Framework 16 users!',
        href: 'https://deovandski.github.io/Deo-s-Framework16-LED-Matrix-Manager/',
        label: "Deo's Framework 16 LED Matrix Manager",
      },
      {
        text: "Haven't used StackOverflow in a long, long while… Times have changed. It's fun and weird!",
        href: 'https://stackoverflow.com/users/4830578/deovandski',
        label: 'My StackOverflow profile',
      },
      {
        text: 'You might be able to glance at some of the X++ fun I had while I worked at Stoneridge Software. Got into the F&O world through them!',
        href: 'https://stoneridgesoftware.com/author/deovandskis/',
        label: 'My posts at Stoneridge Software',
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'author',
    title: 'Author life',
    items: [
      {
        text: 'Yep. As crazy as it sounds, I am also an author, and I did conventions and met a lot of people, from artists to directors and publishers… It feels surreal how much this project pushed me to grow and challenge myself! If you are curious, you can see my evolution throughout the project by reading the Light Novel Afterwords.',
        href: 'http://husbandoutworld.com/',
        label: 'HusbandOutWorld',
      },
      {
        text: 'And given how much world lore I created, and that I am also a technical architect, I decided to put the peanut butter and raspberry jelly together and create a West March D&D Campaign with Claude to let people party about my world! If you find issues or have ideas, submit a PR or open an issue in the GitHub repo!',
        href: 'https://deovandski.github.io/Vraki-West-March-Campaign-D-D/',
        label: 'Vraki West March D&D Campaign',
      },
      {
        text: 'The start of it all! Vraki writing system! It is such a cornerstone of myself, and what became my "author" side, that I had to preserve its history.',
        href: 'https://deovandski.github.io/vraki-windows/',
        label: 'Vraki writing system',
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'social',
    title: 'Social media shenanigans',
    intro: [
      'I was very active back in the day, getting ~15 million views… Focus on <em>was</em>, for there’s nothing left of it. Only an empty YT, my locked-down Steam profile, and my LinkedIn, which remains active.',
      'Will I ever come back? Likely not, because the ROI in knowledge and fun I was getting from being a social influencer towards the end of the journey was gone, and it had become hypervigilance and misery instead. I noticed I was being stalked too, so, like an infection, I cut it off at the root, healed, and moved on.',
    ],
    links: [
      { href: 'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCl57I3mRQhtGkesGWOA5Z-w', label: 'YouTube' },
      { href: 'https://steamcommunity.com/id/deovandski', label: 'Steam' },
      { href: 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/deovandski', label: 'LinkedIn' },
    ],
  },
];
---

<Base hideBrand>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="howdy">
    <div class="hero__sign">
      <Image src={logo} alt="初音ミク tiles above the words Deovandski's Blog" width={576} height={244} loading="eager" />
    </div>
    <div class="hero__text">
      <h1 id="howdy">Howdy!</h1>
      <p class="hero__lede">
        Welcome to my hub! Want to reach out? Find me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/deovandski">LinkedIn</a>.
        Please don't call or text me unless I know you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {
    sections.map((section) => (
      <section class="chapter" id={section.id} aria-labelledby={`${section.id}-title`}>
        <h2 id={`${section.id}-title`}>{section.title}</h2>
        <div class="chapter__body">
          {section.items && (
            <ul class="entries">
              {section.items.map((item) => (
                <li>
                  <p>{item.text}</p>
                  <a class="entry-link" href={item.href}>
                    {item.label}
                  </a>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          )}
          {section.intro && section.intro.map((para) => <p set:html={para} />)}
          {section.links && (
            <ul class="pills">
              {section.links.map((link) => (
                <li>
                  <a href={link.href}>{link.label}</a>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          )}
        </div>
      </section>
    ))
  }
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: 1rem 4rem;
  }
  .hero__sign {
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .hero__sign img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 18px;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px rgba(57, 197, 187, 0.45),
      0 0 60px rgba(57, 197, 187, 0.28),
      0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
    color: var(--teal);
    text-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(57, 197, 187, 0.45);
    margin-bottom: 0.25em;
  }
  .hero__lede {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .chapter {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 16rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
    padding-block: 2.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(190, 200, 209, 0.12);
  }
  .chapter h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--silver);
    position: sticky;
    top: 6rem;
    align-self: start;
  }
  .chapter__body { max-width: var(--measure); }

  .entries {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }
  .entries p { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
  .entry-link {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: var(--step-0);
  }

  .pills {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .pills a {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(57, 197, 187, 0.55);
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .pills a:hover { background: rgba(57, 197, 187, 0.14); }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .chapter { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; padding-block: 2rem; }
    .chapter h2 { position: static; }
  }
</style>
